<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:DejaVu Sans;font-size:10px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th,td{border:1px solid #777;padding:5px}.signature{max-width:120px;max-height:45px}</style></head><body><h2>Planilla / evidencia de asistencia</h2><p><b>Empresa:</b> {{$event->company->razon_social}} · <b>NIT:</b> {{$event->company->nit}}<br><b>Evento:</b> {{$event->title}}<br><b>Origen:</b> {{$event->attendable_type}}<br><b>Fecha:</b> {{$event->starts_at->format('d/m/Y')}} · {{$event->starts_at->format('H:i')}}–{{$event->ends_at->format('H:i')}}</p><table><tr><th>Participante</th><th>Cargo/rol</th><th>Registro</th><th>Método</th><th>Firma capturada</th><th>Código</th></tr>@foreach($event->participants as $p)<tr><td>{{$p->name_snapshot}}</td><td>{{$p->role_snapshot}}</td><td>{{$p->record?->confirmed_at?->format('d/m/Y H:i')??'Pendiente'}}</td><td>{{$p->record?->verification_method??'—'}}</td><td>@if(isset($signatures[$p->record?->id]))<img class="signature" src="{{$signatures[$p->record->id]}}">@else—@endif</td><td>{{$p->record?->verification_code??'—'}}</td></tr>@endforeach</table><p>Las firmas mostradas son firmas manuscritas capturadas como evidencia de asistencia; no corresponden por sí solas a una firma digital certificada.</p></body></html>
